<title>CHINA: Tack Hsin year profit jumps sharply.</title>
<headline>Tack Hsin year profit jumps sharply.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   6.3    vs 2.7</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    5.0    vs 2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    18.97  vs 8.07</p>
<p>    Turnover		     504.09 vs 516.17</p>
<p>    Company name		 Tack Hsin Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 2-8</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   September 11</p>
<p>NOTE - Tack Hsin operates a chain of &quot;hot pot&quot; restaurants.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is seven H.K. cents (including interim dividend of two cents) vs three cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
